{"cues":[{"start":0,"end":3.28,"text":"Hey everybody and welcome back to Lingoni."},{"start":3.28,"end":6.84,"text":"My name is Jenny and today I want to teach you how to say"},{"start":6.84,"end":8.32,"text":"I'm overwhelmed"},{"start":8.32,"end":9.84,"text":"In German."},{"start":9.84,"end":11.76,"text":"Maybe you have too much work,"},{"start":11.76,"end":13.36,"text":"Too many responsibilities,"},{"start":13.36,"end":14.8,"text":"Too many emotions"},{"start":14.8,"end":17.72,"text":"Or maybe life is just a little bit chaotic"},{"start":17.72,"end":20.8,"text":"Right now. There are many natural ways"},{"start":20.8,"end":23.36,"text":"To express that feeling in German."},{"start":23.36,"end":27.24,"text":"From neutral and polite to emotional and dramatic."},{"start":27.24,"end":29.66,"text":"Let's take a closer look."},{"start":36,"end":39.4,"text":"The literal translation would be Ich bin"},{"start":39.4,"end":40.9,"text":"Überfordert."},{"start":41.24,"end":42.8,"text":"I'm overwhelmed."},{"start":42.8,"end":44.4,"text":"Ich bin überfordert."},{"start":44.4,"end":47.2,"text":"Mir wächst alles über den Kopf."},{"start":47.2,"end":49.68,"text":"Everything is getting too much for me."},{"start":49.68,"end":52.28,"text":"Mir wächst alles über den Kopf."},{"start":52.28,"end":53.52,"text":"Ich bin total"},{"start":53.52,"end":54.48,"text":"Gestresst."},{"start":54.48,"end":56.12,"text":"I'm totally stressed."},{"start":56.12,"end":58.08,"text":"Ich bin total gestresst."},{"start":58.08,"end":61.52,"text":"Ich weiß gerade nicht, wo mir der Kopf steht."},{"start":61.52,"end":63.88,"text":"I don't know where my head is right now."},{"start":63.88,"end":65.44,"text":"Ich weiß gerade nicht,"},{"start":65.44,"end":67.52,"text":"Wo mir der Kopf steht."},{"start":67.52,"end":70.16,"text":"Es ist mir gerade alles zuviel."},{"start":70.16,"end":72.48,"text":"Everything is too much for me right now."},{"start":72.48,"end":74.44,"text":"Es ist mir gerade alles zuviel."},{"start":74.44,"end":77.08,"text":"Ich komme gerade an meine Grenzen."},{"start":77.08,"end":79.32,"text":"I'm reaching my limits right now."},{"start":79.32,"end":82.12,"text":"Ich komme gerade an meine Grenzen."},{"start":82.12,"end":83.36,"text":"Ich bin mental"},{"start":83.36,"end":85.08,"text":"Gerade am Limit."},{"start":85.08,"end":87.68,"text":"I'm mentally at my limit right now."},{"start":87.68,"end":90.32,"text":"Ich bin mental gerade am Limit."},{"start":90.32,"end":92.52,"text":"Ich bin komplett überlastet."},{"start":92.52,"end":94.48,"text":"I'm completely maxed out."},{"start":94.48,"end":95.88,"text":"Ich bin komplett"},{"start":95.88,"end":97.24,"text":"Überlastet."},{"start":97.24,"end":101.28,"text":"Ich schaffe das gerade alles nicht. I can't handle all that right now."},{"start":101.28,"end":103.44,"text":"Ich schaffe das gerade alles nicht."},{"start":103.44,"end":106.24,"text":"Ich bin fix und fertig."},{"start":106.24,"end":107.52,"text":"I'm exhausted."},{"start":107.52,"end":109.84,"text":"Ich bin fix und fertig."},{"start":109.84,"end":112.48,"text":"Oder Ich bin total fertig."},{"start":112.48,"end":114.56,"text":"Ich bin total fertig."},{"start":114.56,"end":115.72,"text":"Ich bin"},{"start":115.72,"end":116.8,"text":"Am Ende."},{"start":116.8,"end":118.04,"text":"I'm done."},{"start":118.04,"end":120.62,"text":"Ich bin am Ende."},{"start":139.64,"end":141.7,"text":"Bis bald. Tschüss."}],"auto":true}